step.prompt:
Project description: {{project_description}}
Context: {{context}}

Identify {{numberOfStakeholders}} stakeholders with their name and role.

step.response_schema:
class Stakeholder(BaseModel):
  name: str
  role: str

class ContextAndStakeholders(BaseModel):
  stakeholders: list[Stakeholder]

step.prompt:
For each stakeholder, identify:
- Top 3 interests for this project
- Power level to influence (0-100)

Stakeholders: {{stakeholders}}
Project: {{project_description}}

step.response_schema:
class Profile(BaseModel):
  name: str
  interests: list[str]
  power: int

class InterestsConcerns(BaseModel):
  profiles: list[Profile]

step.prompt:
Create engagement strategy for all groups:
Mapping: {{stakeholder_mapping}} Profiles: {{interests_concerns}}
For each group provide: - Engagement approach - Communication channels (email, meeting, workshop, etc) - Frequency (weekly, monthly, quarterly)
